; Shale installer copy — extends Tauri's English strings.

LangString chooseHowToInstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Choose how you want to install Shale. The last slicer you'll ever download. Shale is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 or later (AGPL-3.0-or-later)."
LangString createDesktop ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Create a desktop shortcut"
LangString alreadyInstalledLong ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${PRODUCTNAME} ${VERSION} is already installed. Add components, reinstall, or uninstall to continue."